run ALL scripts as sudo, as otherwise they will NOT work!
run audit.sh first, then based off of results and CP README, run more specific scripts

whenever you run a script, and make a change, check your points! if you lose points, undo the change immediately, and reconsult the CP README.

ALSO, MOST SCRIPTS WILL HAVE HUGE OUTPUTS!!! DIRECT THEM INTO A FILE, THEN GREP THROUGH IT!!!!!